json/structured
description: Composite value that nests other JSON values
- >
  A **structured** value nests other values. JSON has exactly two structured shapes - the keyed
  **object** and the positional **list** - and they nest into each other freely:
- !!<format: text/x-json> |
  {"matrix": [[1, 0], [0, 1]], "meta": {"unit": true}}
- >
  See the subchapters below for the two shapes:
- *: 00-json_object
- *: 01-json_list
